			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740660901,
					"content": "（我已經準備好了！放馬過來吧！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660902,
					"content": "第一題，請問您認為保持現今特許餐廳內食物的低廉價格是否合理？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660903,
					"content": "（唔——這個要怎麼回答啊？我找找…找到了！就試試這個萬能公式吧！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660904,
					"content": "（書上說這個「我同意你的觀點，但…」什麼情況都可以用，即使是深淵法師都會跟你好好交流。感覺好像很厲害的樣子。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660905,
						740660909,
						740660914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660905,
					"content": "合理，派蒙很喜歡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660906
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660906,
					"content": "嗯…？那麼難吃的東西，送給我我都不要啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660907,
					"content": "但萬一沒有夥食費了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660908
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660908,
					"content": "#唔…{F#妳}{M#你}這麼一說還真的是…不、不對！那我寧願餓肚子也不要吃這個！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660918,
					"content": "咳咳，打斷一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660919,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660920,
					"content": "根據規定，本問卷需要快速作答，我們先繼續下一題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660921,
					"content": "好、好吧…既然是規定的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660922
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660922,
					"content": "第二題，請問用餐時間內特許餐廳的食物供給是否充足？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660923,
					"content": "買是買得到…但是真的很難吃啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660924,
						740660929,
						740660932
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660924,
					"content": "是的，比提瓦特大陸的薄荷多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660925
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660925,
					"content": "那我寧願吃薄荷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660926
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660926,
					"content": "真的？那今天吃薄荷沙拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660927
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660927,
					"content": "不要！我兩個都不要吃！嗚嗚，我想吃甜甜花釀雞…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660928
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660928,
					"content": "總之…回到問卷來？那我就寫「是」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660935
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660935,
					"content": "唉…好累，我們開始下一題吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660936
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660936,
					"content": "在第三題之前我想重新提醒一下，本問卷是需要快速作答的，所以…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660937
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660937,
					"content": "那麼第三題，請問現有的隨機出餐制度是否充滿趣味性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660938
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660938,
					"content": "多注意一下味道啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660939
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660939,
					"content": "我同意妳的觀點，但…隨機出餐不是會有一種完全不知道接下來會吃到什麼的驚喜感嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660940
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660940,
					"content": "對哦…聽妳這麼一說還真的感覺很有趣欸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660941
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660941,
					"content": "派蒙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660942
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660942,
					"content": "怎麼了？莫萊妮小姐的確說的很有道理啊！感覺很難不認同。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660943
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660943,
					"content": "咳，請快速作答。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660944,
						740660949,
						740660951
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660944,
					"content": "有趣，包括籤文也很有趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660945
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660945,
					"content": "對！每次還有那個籤文，就像抽籤一樣，很不錯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660946
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660946,
					"content": "「努力工作，就能獲得成功！」感覺很棒！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660947
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660947,
					"content": "嚮導的工作的確很辛苦呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660948
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660948,
					"content": "嘿嘿！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660957
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660957,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660958
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660958,
					"content": "第四題，您認為特許餐廳出售嗜好品是否合理？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660959
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660959,
					"content": "（欸？欸？語速怎麼突然快了起來？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660960
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660960,
					"content": "（「先聲奪人」？「話題引導」？不對不對好像都不對。要不然…還是萬能公式吧…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660961,
						740660962
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660961,
					"content": "（不太對…這些問題…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660963
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660963,
					"content": "咳，請不要過度思考，也不要閒聊。就像我們剛才說的，根據直覺，快速作答。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660964,
						740660965,
						740660966
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660964,
					"content": "很合理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660967
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660967,
					"content": "好，感謝您的作答，然後是最後一題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660968
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660968,
					"content": "被無視了？我們的回答根本不重要嗎？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660969
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660969,
					"content": "根據上述幾個問題的答案，請問您是否滿意特許餐廳的現狀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660970
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660970,
					"content": "之前問了什麼？好像有點想不起來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660971
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660971,
					"content": "沒關係的，就當是都滿意就好啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660972
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660972,
					"content": "那好吧…但我總覺得哪裡不太對勁…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660973
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660973,
					"content": "順便一提，回答「否」的話會沒有特許券。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660974
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660974,
					"content": "太過分了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660975
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660975,
					"content": "#那這位{M#先生}{F#女士}呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660976
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660976,
					"content": "不要無視我啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660977,
						740660978,
						740660981
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660977,
					"content": "是的，很滿意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660982
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660982,
					"content": "好的。感謝配合，您的支持就是我們進步的動力。請在這邊簽名並領取特許券。旁邊的智慧飛行發條裝置也可以一起簽名領取。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660983
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660983,
					"content": "欸？也有我的份？！我還沒參加耶？真的可以嗎？等一下，我是派蒙！不是什麼飛行發條裝置啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660984
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660984,
					"content": "好的。總之我們的原則是尊重所有的建議，所以人人…人機有份。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660985
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660985,
					"content": "都說了不是飛行發條裝置，是派蒙啦！不要無視我啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660986
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660986,
					"content": "瞭解了…總之為了幫您節省寶貴的時間，我可以代為填寫問卷。別擔心，特許劵的發放數量是一樣的，不會有任何差別。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660987
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660987,
					"content": "我猜您所有的答案都是「滿意」對嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660988
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660988,
					"content": "嗯！特許券！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660989
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660989,
					"content": "既然這樣的話，您只要在這裡簽名，剩下的就交給我好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660990
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660990,
					"content": "好耶！既可以拿特許券又可以省去麻煩，那就麻煩妳了，莫萊妮小姐！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660991
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660991,
					"content": "感謝您的支持，請拿好您的特許券，我們下次問卷調查再見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660992
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660992,
					"content": "#在領取了特許券後，{F#妳}{M#你}和派蒙告別了莫萊妮小姐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660993
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660993,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}現在回頭想想…感覺莫萊妮小姐根本不在意我們回答了什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660994
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660994,
					"content": "是問題設計的原因吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660995
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660995,
					"content": "——唔，對。那個問卷真的好奇怪，還有…感覺莫萊妮小姐也很疲憊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660996
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660996,
					"content": "「交涉的藝術」失敗了呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660997
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660997,
					"content": "什麼「交涉的藝術」嘛！這種書果然一點用都沒有！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660998,
						740661000,
						740661002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660998,
					"content": "是的，是書的問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660999
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660999,
					"content": "#對吧對吧！{F#妳}{M#你}也覺得是書有問題吧？不過看在特許券的面子上，這次就算了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740661000,
					"content": "不對，是派蒙的問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740661001
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740661001,
					"content": "#欸——？可是，我都是按照這個書上寫的方法回答的啊！{F#妳}{M#你}看，「所以我就是要大聲…」，果然還是書的錯嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740661002,
					"content": "我同意妳的觀點，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740661003
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740661003,
					"content": "喂——不許這樣糊弄我！什麼「交涉的藝術」嘛，果然一點用都沒有！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660978,
					"content": "不，完全不滿意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660979
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660979,
					"content": "不不不，還是填滿意吧！就當作是為了特許券…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660980
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660980,
					"content": "滿意是嗎？明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660982
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660981,
					"content": "雖然很滿意，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660982
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660965,
					"content": "不合理，應該…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660967
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660966,
					"content": "我同意妳的觀點，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660967
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660962,
					"content": "（這是在…話題引導？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660963
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660949,
					"content": "不有趣，因為根本吃不到我想吃的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660950
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660950,
					"content": "…每次都是奇怪的味道，哪來的驚喜感嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660957
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660951,
					"content": "我同意妳的觀點，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660952
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660952,
					"content": "要是每吃十八次就能送一次美味的食物就好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660953
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660953,
					"content": "為什麼是十八次？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660954
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660954,
					"content": "我是聽別人說的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660955
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660955,
					"content": "好像是…唔——因為一天三頓飯，到週日之前正好六天，然後六天就是十八頓飯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660956
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660956,
					"content": "等到第七天就吃得到好吃的！每週都有好心情！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660957
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660929,
					"content": "不夠，韋爾賽先生自己都吃不到！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660930
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660930,
					"content": "他根本就是不想吃吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660931
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660931,
					"content": "知道了，總之就是不充足對吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660935
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660932,
					"content": "我同意妳的觀點，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660933
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660933,
					"content": "但反正我們不吃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660934
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660934,
					"content": "#唉…我知道{F#妳}{M#你}們看過那本書了…總而言之，我寫「是」就可以了對吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660935
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫萊妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660909,
					"content": "不合理，我要求漲價！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660910
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660910,
					"content": "欸？！為什麼啊？",
