					"content": "我不要最好的，我要最貴的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660912
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660912,
					"content": "這是什麼奇怪的想法啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660913,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}…{F#妳}{M#你}還好嗎…感覺{F#妳}{M#你}不太對勁，不會是吃了什麼奇怪的東西吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740660914,
					"content": "我同意妳的觀點，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740660915
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740660915,
					"content": "但？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
